### Failure Handling

**Failure Modes and Mitigations:**

| Failure Mode | Detection | Mitigation | Fallback |
|--------------|-----------|------------|----------|
| LLM API timeout | Request timeout >30s | Retry with exponential backoff (3 attempts) | Keep existing layer unchanged |
| Invalid JSON output | Parse error | Log for analysis, retry once with "output valid JSON" appended to prompt | Keep existing layer |
| Schema validation fail | jsonschema error | Log structured error, alert on-call | Keep existing layer |
| Low confidence output | All clusters <0.5 | Treat as signal of insufficient data | Keep existing layer, flag user for review |
| Rate limit hit | 429 response | Backoff and queue for next batch window | Delay update by 1 hour |
| LLM returns PII | PII detection scan | Block write, alert privacy team | Keep existing layer, manual review |

